  "solution": {
    "text": "Calcination is required for hydroxide carbonate and hydrated ores. So, calcination&nbsp;for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ZnO</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>MgO</mi></math> will not occur."
